| !Run for !Reel (a video player, from riscos-ffmpeg)
| Puts Reel on the icon bar. Drop a video on it, or double-click a video
| in the Filer while Reel is loaded. %*0 = a file to play at once.
Set Reel$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Reel$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Reel needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Reel needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| Sound: SharedSoundBuffer and StreamManager (John Duffell's ssb.zip) when
| they are loaded.

| The program is about 29MB; its memory for pictures and sound is in a
| dynamic area ("Reel Heap").
WimpSlot -min 40960K -max 40960K
Run <Reel$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
